            </note>
            <note corresp="#d31-f4" n="42" xml:id="d31-f4-content">
                <p>See memorandum of July 4 by the Ambassador in Japan, <ref
                        target="frus1931-41v01#pg_605"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                            Relations</hi>, Japan, 1931–1941, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >i</hi>, pp. 605</ref>, <ref target="frus1931-41v01#pg_610"
                    >610</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d31-f5" n="43" xml:id="d31-f5-content">
                <p>See telegram No. 945, July 5, noon, from the Consul General at Shanghai, <ref
                        target="frus1938v03#pg_211">vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">iii</hi>, p.
                        211</ref>.</p>
            </note>
